  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0: RFC-005 optional persistent snapshots: lock-free stable partition view (TryGetStableView), BinarySnapshotSerializer, FileSystemSnapshotStore with atomic temp+rename writes and pruning (SnapshotsToKeep), SnapshotHostedService with bounded queue and MaxConcurrentSnapshotJobs, exponential backoff retry (IBackoffPolicy/ExponentialBackoffPolicy), restore path (RestoreFromSnapshotsAsync) with schema validation, fail-fast option validation (ValidateSnapshotOptions), optional local tracing via ActivitySource (disabled by default), Noop delta hooks, greater than 85% coverage tests (stable view concurrency/wrap-around, retry/backoff success and failure, pruning accuracy, restore, fail-fast, atomic write ignoring .tmp, backpressure, latency regression ≤ +2%). Hot path (Append/Query) unchanged (≤ +2% p50/p99). v1.0.12: Strengthened validation (InvalidOperationException), internal refactors (ring buffer, partitioners), unified 'var' usage, large test expansion (builder, options edge cases, runtime and bucketed windows, zero-allocation paths, concurrency). v1.0.11-1.0.9: MetricsDashboard tests, script enhancements (UTC), window tracking and bucketed aggregation, early option validation, zero-allocation optimizations, padded counters.",
